WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
- You just wrapped your
first tour since coming out,

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:03.330
so how was this different?

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.800
Did you feel like, I don't know,

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.020
more comfortable, more at ease,

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:06.870
like more yourself?

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.070
- Well okay, so it's kind of funny.

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.870
There's this, before I came out,

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.620
you know, I had this section in my show.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.070
I started this show before I came out,

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.760
and there's a part in
it called "Sportyland",

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.430
and Sportyland was
everybody's least favorite,

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:20.380
because it was just like,

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.830
we had like Candyland,

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.290
and then we had like BowBowland,

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.640
and then we had like Sportyland
and it was like baseball.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.180
That's Sportyland actually.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.013
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:29.210
- [JoJo] And everyone didn't like it,

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.370
because the colors were
just like a little,

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.480
not pink and purple,

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.450
like it was just was
a full different vibe.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.890
But then this round of tour,

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.040
you know, since coming out,

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.550
and like, not to be a stereotypical,

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:42.330
but like, it's a thing that
lesbians play softball.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.433
Like it's just a thing.

00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:44.266
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:44.266 --> 00:00:45.099
- Oh my god.

00:00:45.099 --> 00:00:47.030
- [JoJo] And so to have, it's a thing.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.320
- And straight women, but yes.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.770
- And straight women, well.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:50.603
Well.

00:00:50.603 --> 00:00:51.436
(audience laughing)

00:00:51.436 --> 00:00:52.269
- And straight women.

00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:53.762
I know straight women that play softball-

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:54.920
- I have played co-ed softball.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:57.497
The one where you have the
pony keg at second base.

00:00:57.497 --> 00:00:58.330
(audience laughs)

00:00:58.330 --> 00:00:59.163
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:59.163 --> 00:01:01.244
Did you say a pony keg at second base?

00:01:01.244 --> 00:01:03.130
I wanna go to that softball.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:04.810
- It's so great.

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:05.770
Okay.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.146
- But, so it was like
everyone now like had this,

00:01:08.146 --> 00:01:10.610
you know, we had our baseball bats,

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.443
and like, it was Sportyland.

00:01:11.443 --> 00:01:12.276
It was like-

00:01:12.276 --> 00:01:13.109
- Oh my gosh-

00:01:13.109 --> 00:01:13.942
- The gayland.

00:01:13.942 --> 00:01:14.775
- I love you so much.

00:01:14.775 --> 00:01:15.608
- It ended up being everyone's favorite,

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.850
but it was so nice to be like, just free,

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:18.892
like people would bring-

00:01:18.892 --> 00:01:19.725
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:01:19.725 --> 00:01:21.340
- [JoJo] Pride flags and it was so cool.

